{"reviewId": "53963609_85caQurPW", "review": {"abstract": "康波的本质表现是价格的波动，而人生的财富积累根本上源于资产价格的投资或投机，人生财富靠康波，康波就是人生的财富规划。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "人生财富靠康波的核心的核心：人一生仅能经历1-2轮完整康波，抓住一次周期机会，财富层级可跨越；踏错周期，再努力也难突破，康波本质是人生财富的“节奏指南”，不是投机捷径，是顺势而为的规划核心。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "1237-1295", "createTime": 1765020458, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "53963609_85caQurPW", "userVid": 53963609, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 53963609, "name": "Jessica.Yang", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0024-5L2hbgUTiL~Ef3wWv1udK10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241111-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 131, "likes": [{"userVid": 440847832, "name": "宏观是道", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/8Ta45AtetHQibECDIJyhrFTN8jXvgO0vdZElf8P2evkPWic1bcZmqfXAZsxs558Zv9WxiajBTYR2hh7Ohia7e9NdMCS9libiaIHbS2rd65ibshLAQM/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M8-202402-40", "desc": "每月阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读月", "levelIndex": 40}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "周期定